sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Browser Tab 40
  participant E as Browser Extension 10
  participant P as Permission Manager 70
  participant G as Gateway Module 20
  participant L as Audit Log 60
  participant C as CLI 30

  T->>E: navigation event
  E->>E: compare current origin with permitted origin
  alt origin changed
    E->>P: revoke(tabId, reason=origin_changed)
    P->>G: update permitted tab list
    G->>L: append revoke audit entry
    G-->>C: tab no longer permitted
  else same origin
    E-->>P: keep permission
  end
